cial failure; loser","englishDescription":"A person who failed to achieve what he/she wanted or pursued.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=66220&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:66221:1","headword":"실패작","partOfSpeech":"noun","partOfSpeechKo":"명사","definitionKo":"원하거나 목적한 대로 만들지 못한 작품.","englishExpression":"failure; flop","englishDescription":"A work not made as wanted or intended.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=66221&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:70711:2","headword":"유산","partOfSpeech":"noun","partOfSpeechKo":"명사","definitionKo":"(비유적으로) 계획하거나 추진하는 일이 제대로 이루어지지 못함.","englishExpression":"failure","englishDescription":"(figurative) The failure to carry out a plan or project to the end.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=70711&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:73374:3","headword":"장애","partOfSpeech":"noun","partOfSpeechKo":"명사","definitionKo":"통신에서 신호의 전송을 방해하는 잡음이나 혼신 등의 물리적 현상.","englishExpression":"failure; interference","englishDescription":"In telecommunications, a physical phenomenon such as static, interference, etc., that inhibits signal transmission.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=73374&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:80635:1","headword":"파탄","partOfSpeech":"noun","partOfSpeechKo":"명사","definitionKo":"일이나 계획 등이 잘 진행되지 못하고 도중에 잘못됨.","englishExpression":"failure","englishDescription":"The state of a task, plan, etc., not working out and going wrong in the process.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=80635&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:80758:1","headword":"패","partOfSpeech":"noun","partOfSpeechKo":"명사","definitionKo":"어떤 일을 실패함. 또는 싸움이나 경기 등에서 짐.","englishExpression":"failure; loss; defeat","englishDescription":"A failure in doing something, or an act of losing a fight, game, etc.","sourceUrl":"https://